# text = A board had rattled under her feet in the great nursery where she played , and on attention being drawn to it , it was found to be loose , and so removed , revealed a ladder , leading to a hiding-place between the floor of the nursery and the ceiling of the room below -- a hiding-place so small that he who had hid there must have crouched on his hands and knees or lain at full length , and yet large enough to contain a quaint old carved oak chest , half filled with priests' vestments , which had been hidden away , no doubt , in those cruel days when the life of a man was in danger if he was discovered to have harbored a Roman Catholic priest , or to have mass said in his house .
