# text = Once or twice , while she sat silently thinking , she removed one of her hands from before her face , and fidgeted nervously with the ribbon , clutching at it with a half-angry gesture , and twisting it backward and forward between her fingers she said , by-and-by She said this with so much bitterness in her tone , that the surgeon's wife looked up at her with surprise she exclaimed After this conversation they often spoke upon the subject , and Lucy never again showed any emotion whatever when the baronet's admiration for her was canvassed .
