# text = There was something almost touching in the manner and tone in which he spoke to her -- half in deprecation , knowing that he could hardly expect to be the choice of a beautiful young girl , and praying rather that she would reject him , even though she broke his heart by doing so , than that she should accept his offer if she did not love him he said , solemnly he repeated , earnestly Lucy Graham was not looking at Sir Michael , but straight out into the misty twilight and dim landscape far away beyond the little garden .
