# text = I cannot tell how long he sat blankly staring at one paragraph among the list of deaths , before his dazed brain took in its full meaning ; but after considerable pause he pushed the newspaper over to Robert Audley , and with a face that had changed from its dark bronze to a sickly , chalky grayish white , and with an awful calmness in his manner , he pointed with his finger to a line which ran thus THE HEADSTONE AT VENTNOR .
