# text = When Robert , therefore , was about to re-enter the inn , it needed but the faintest elevation of Lucy's eyebrows , with a charming expression of weariness and terror , to make her husband aware that she did not want to be bored by an introduction to Mr . George Talboys he said My lady was so terribly fatigued that she could only smile sweetly , and hold out a tiny gloved hand to her nephew by marriage she said , in a low and tired voice .
