# text = Again , had he been in love with her himself , I fancy that the tender passion would , with him , have been so vague and feeble a sentiment that he might have gone down to his grave with a dim sense of some uneasy sensation which might be love or indigestion , and with , beyond this , no knowledge whatever of his state .
