# text = The birds had sung so much all the morning , that they had , perhaps , by this time grown tired ; the lazy cattle were asleep in the meadows ; Sir Michael was still away on his morning's ramble ; Miss Alicia had scampered off an hour before on her chestnut mare ; the servants were all at dinner in the back part of the house ; and my lady had strolled , book in hand , into the shadowy lime-walk ; so the gray old building had never worn a more peaceful aspect than on that bright afternoon when George Talboys walked across the lawn to ring a sonorous peal at the sturdy , iron-bound oak door .
