# text = At last he read it carefully over , stopping at some of the numbered paragraphs , and marking some of them with a pencil cross ; then he folded the sheet of foolscap , went over to a cabinet on the opposite side of the room , unlocked it , and placed the paper in that very pigeon-hole into which he had thrust Alicia's letter -- the pigeon-hole marked _Important_ .
