# text = Robert , who was short-sighted , had his eyes within half an inch of the surface of the map as the young lady approached him he said He turned round so as to intercept Miss Audley on her way to the staircase replied his cousin curtly , trying to pass him The young lady did not condescend to reply replied Alicia , looking at her cousin as a handsome young panther might look at its daring tormentor said Alicia , still trying to pass her cousin cried Alicia , passionately said Robert Audley , grasping his cousin's slender little wrist , and leading her up-stairs
