# text = It was exactly five minutes past four as Mr . Robert Audley stepped out upon the platform at Shoreditch , and waited placidly until such time as his dogs and his portmanteau should be delivered up to the attendant porter who had called his cab , and undertaken the general conduct of his affairs , with that disinterested courtesy which does such infinite credit to a class of servitors who are forbidden to accept the tribute of a grateful public .
