# text = The bright brunette complexion had lost its glowing crimson , and the animation of the young lady's manner was suppressed -- on account of her father's illness , no doubt , Robert thought the barrister said , after a very leisurely contemplation of his cousin Miss Audley shrugged her shoulders , but did not condescend to lift her eyes from her book she answered , contemptuously thought the barrister .
