# text = Alicia looked out at the drizzling rain drifting against the broad window-panes she said Have you ever heard anybody , whom you knew to be dead , alluded to in a light , easy going manner by another person who did not know of his death -- alluded to as doing that or this , as performing some trivial everyday operation -- when _you_ know that he has vanished away from the face of this earth , and separated himself forever from all living creatures and their commonplace pursuits in the awful solemnity of death ?
