# text = Robert had a prim bedroom , and an uncompromising dressing-room allotted him in the square house , and he woke every morning upon a metallic spring mattress , which always gave him the idea of sleeping upon some musical instrument , to see the sun glaring in upon him through the square , white blinds and lighting up the two lackered urns which adorned the foot of the blue iron bedstead , until they blazed like two tiny brazen lamps of the Roman period .
