# text = But there was generally a third person who assisted in the constitutional promenades , and that third person was Clara Talboys , who used to walk by her father's side , more beautiful than the morning -- for that was sometimes dull and cloudy , while she was always fresh and bright -- in a broad-leaved straw-hat and flapping blue ribbons , one quarter of an inch of which Mr . Audley would have esteemed a prouder decoration than ever adorned a favored creature's button-hole .
